[terence@cory.Berkeley.EDU wants to know about nethack2.3:]
> Too many different kinds of dragons to genocide ... What to do?

in nh2.3 scrolls of genocide (generally) wipe out all monsters of a
given class (i.e. typing "D" will wipe out all dragons including the
black dragon that is disintegrating you). you used to need to eat a
dead dragon (any kind) to get fire resistance but that was made risky
and an easier way is to sacrifice food rations and pray until you get
Hand of Elbereth (can you spell dog backwards?).

> Ring of teleport control. how do you get to hell without it?

after the regular room-style levels comes the maze level(s). search
around this level and you'll find a wand of wishing usually under an
enormous rock. borrow the wand of digging from the minotaur, if
necessary, don't worry about giving it back! zap the w.o.w. and type:
a ring of telport control
you can now go to hell on your own terms, find a level teleport trap or
get confused and read a teleport scroll (remember fire resistance). try
to go to level 99 but don't be surprised if you only make it to 60 or so.

